{"overview":"پس از یک تراژدی خانوادگی که زندگی‌اش را واژگون کرد، توهرو هوندا، دانش‌آموز ۱۶ ساله دبیرستانی، تصمیم می‌گیرد خود دست به کار شود و به یک چادر نقل مکان کند! متأسفانه این چادر را در زمینی خصوصی متعلق به خاندان مرموز سُما می‌نهد و به زودی صاحبین آن راز او را کشف می‌کنند. اما همان‌طور که توهرو می‌فهمد، سُماها نیز راز خود را دارند: وقتی توسط جنس مخالف در آغوش می‌گیرند، به حیوانات زودیاک چینی تبدیل می‌شوند!","tagline":"","overview_en":"After a family tragedy turns her life upside down, 16-year-old high school student Tohru Honda takes matters into her own hands and moves out… into a tent! Unfortunately for her, she pitches her new home on private land belonging to the mysterious Soma clan, and it isn't long before the owners discover her secret. But, as Tohru quickly finds out when the family offers to take her in, the Somas have a secret of their own—when hugged by the opposite sex, they turn into the animals of the Chinese Zodiac!","tagline_en":"","runtime":24,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":25,"y":2019,"poster":"/cmPyUpFgHjHN3hy5vnHwY6fmDFk.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":25,"y":2020,"poster":"/bvE9TkoKDjITjMAFUHLUAJzD3JS.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":13,"y":2021,"poster":"/ymUm25ipczUKswRRMe8DuEs1MXh.jpg"}],"episodes":63,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP","US"],"cast":[{"name":"ماناکا ایوامی","role":"Tohru Honda (voice)","photo":"/leKMaCBswXG8u4mfQNQ7J3y6Xow.jpg","en":"Manaka Iwami"},{"name":"島﨑信長","role":"Yuki Sōma (voice)","photo":"/qke5rZusHsjSlvB0NKlJ5dQF5D.jpg","en":"Nobunaga Shimazaki"},{"name":"内田雄馬","role":"Kyō Sōma (voice)","photo":"/2otstbLfQ7MXuFt1X8MFOb4OIgd.jpg","en":"Yuma Uchida"},{"name":"中村悠一","role":"Shigure Sōma (voice)","photo":"/wb8behVKjBHX9XXrEydvNINCYwH.jpg","en":"Yuichi Nakamura"},{"name":"釘宮理恵","role":"Kagura Sōma (voice)","photo":"/xHonhNFpTpz9zCVXLAF7D4OuHLv.jpg","en":"Rie Kugimiya"},{"name":"潘めぐみ","role":"Momiji Sōma (voice)","photo":"/cwnwrPg1YvB19TbfouC4ShGPmbQ.jpg","en":"Megumi Han"},{"name":"古